Intel(r) Itanium(r) Architecture Software Developer's Manual
Specification Update Available

The Intel(r) Itanium(r) Architecture Software Developer's Manual
Specification Update Revision 9.0, for Volumes 1-3 is available at:

http://developer.intel.com/design/itanium/downloads/248699.htm

This document is a compilation of specification changes,
specification clarifications, and documentation changes.

New items covered in this collateral include:
* Architecture extensions for processor Performance/Power states
* Addition of tf instruction
* Addition of PAL_BRAND_INFO
* Other Clarifications and Documentation Changes
This document does not cover errata descriptions.
